r weapon does scattering into essence when using this charm, gonna be a great party trick.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T07:23:13-07:00","id":128933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gayo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=127514#post127514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> This seems a little weak, but we'll need to see what 3e looks like, I guess. It also depends somewhat on how the game contextualizes things -- my experience is that a game has to <i>really </i>drill into your head the importance of using a pile of modifiers all the time before a power that negates non-specific situational penalties becomes useful by itself. As it stands it's always been pretty uncommon for people to apply one-sided penalties to opposed rolls.<br /> <br /> I'm a little wary of blanket penalty negators generally, because they have the tendency to make the game more like a white-room.</div> </div> </div> </div>I liked it. Specifically the close range part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you think nobody cares if you're alive, try missing a couple of payments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2890-walker-of-ebony-clouds","name":"Walker-of-Ebony-Clouds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T07:17:04-07:00","id":129873,"title":"","content":"Investigation:<br /> <br /> <b>Counter-Ambush Insight</b><br /> By quickly analyzing the layout of her surroundings and the behaviour of the people around her, the Solar can learn the precariousness of her situation and the intentions of would-be enemies. The Solar rolls Wits + Investigation. If the roll is successful, she immediately knows if any of the people around her and of whom she is aware are planning on attacking her or causing her arm during the rest of the scene. In addition, the Solar can find the perfect spot to defend against the attack, if there is one. If the Solar chooses to stay and confront her attackers, she gains momentum equal to her Investigation upon rolling Join Battle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T07:20:31-07:00","id":132163,"title":"","content":"Melee:<br /> <br /> <b>Iron Heart of the Crimson Storm</b><br /> <br /> This Charm supplements a close-range attack against a battle group. If the attack is successful, the battle group takes a penalty to its combat movement dice equal to the Solar's melee rating. If the battle group moves away from the Solar, all ongoing penalties directly imposed upon the Solar by the battle group's actions immediately end. This Charm lasts for one scene.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T06:35:18-07:00","id":133646,"title":"","content":"Occult:<br /> <br /> <b>Faith of the Sorcerer-King</b><br /> The Solar's mastery of forbidden lore is bolstered by the worship of his followers. If the Solar receives motes from the Cult merit, she may &quot;store&quot; some or all of these motes so that they can be used to empower a spell or sorcerous working. The Solar may keep (Essence x 5) motes stored at any given time from this method.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T06:41:23-07:00","id":135306,"title":"","content":"War:<br /> <br /> <b>Unyielding Entrenchment Manoeuvre</b>:<br /> <br /> Upon activating this Charm, the Solar immediately spots a suitable defensive position on the battlefield. If a battle group under the Solar's command moves to that position within (Solar's War rating) rounds of the charm's activation, the battle group increases its soak by (Solar's Essence / 2, rounded up). This charm lasts for one scene, but immediately ends if the battle group moves away from its strategic position.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T06:51:45-07:00","id":136628,"title":"","content":"Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Scroll of Manyfold Meanings</b><br /> This charm supplements an attempt at social influence through written communication. Those who read the Solar's words automatically interpret them within the context of one of their Minor Intimacies. Repurchases of this charm allow it to exploit Major and Defining Intimacies at a higher activation cost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T08:36:38-07:00","id":138082,"title":"","content":"Ride: <br /> <br /> <b>Dragon and Rider Are One</b><br /> By activating this charm, the Solar automatically becomes used to the natural environment of her chosen mount. She does not suffer any penalties or damage due to environmental hazards and her own vital functions, such as breathing, become the same as her mount. For example, a Solar riding a whale would gain the ability to breathe underwater and to survive the immense pressure of the ocean depths. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T06:21:38-07:00","id":139242,"title":"","content":"Integrity:<br /> <br /> <b>Gilded Hopes of Leaden Treasures</b><br /> When resisting social influence, the Solar can activate this charm to call upon an Intimacy which she held at some point in her life, but no longer believes in. This charm can also be used to temporarily negate any ongoing effect that suppresses one of the Solar's Intimacies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T10:06:17-07:00","id":139442,"title":"","content":"That last one seems like it'd take a lot of bookkeeping. Not only do you need to keep track of a player's Intimacies, you also need to keep track of every Intimacy you've ever had in case it becomes relevant. Plus it's got the perverse incentive of encouraging specific types of backgrounds (opposing the Realm right now is nice, but if you were a devout Immaculate before you Exalted, you get a free Intimacy that only applies when you want it to!). Plus, as the Solar grows older, the Charm comes closer to &quot;Pay X motes to act like you've got a relevant Intimacy,&quot; which kind of defeats the point of Intimacies in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1369-mewtarthio","name":"Mewtarthio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T22:30:02-07:00","id":140269,"title":"","content":"<b>Peerless Infiltration Method</b>:<br /> <br /> By analyzing the defenses around a building, site or encampment the Lawgiver can develop a plan that will allow herself and (essence X2) companions to infiltrate that site, and combine their disparate skill sets into an action worthy of the Unconquered Sun. While executing this plan, all of the companions:<ul><li>Are immune to discovery by unenlightened mortals. Mere guards will always look in the wrong places for the Lawgiver and her companions as they hide in places mortals simply do not bother to look.</li> <li>Are able to use the Lawgiver's Stealth skill (plus any relevant specialties) in place of their own .</li> <li>Piece the outer most layer of the site's defenses. This effect is arbitrated by the Story teller, but means that all the affected characters are able to Perfectly access the area, though they can risk discovery later on (ex: <i> Isana </i><i>Two Nail </i><i>and her companions are infiltrating Thorns. Careful examination of the guard schedule allows the group to exploit a gap and slip over the walls unseen by climbing some bamboo that grew to close to the city. Isana and her companions are on the roof of a building adjacent to the out wall</i>)</li> <li>All affect characters have memorized all <i>available</i> information about the site, and instinctively know the fastest (not safest) route to the target, and the fastest (not Safest) path to the nearest exit.</li> </ul><br /> Charm Concept: Any Shadowrun GMs? Know how an infiltration session can devolve into 2 hrs of planning, and then collapse? This Charm is meant to bypass that and get the sneakiness underway as quickly as possible. It also simulates how pulp heroes are never discovered by mere guards,even if they have to display cleverness in avoiding them. Call it the Ocean's Eleven Charm, and an Essence 5 solar can indeed field a party of up to 11 people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T06:28:37-07:00","id":140462,"title":"","content":"Socialize:<br /> <br /> <b>Harmonious Mirroring Scholarship</b><br /> When out of her element, the Solar learns by studying the actions, words and expressions of those around her. Upon activating this charm, the Solar gains a specialty relevant to the social group she is interacting with. This specialty can belong to any ability and can be used to gain specialized knowledge relevant to the group, or to understand the hierarchy of the social group or the personalities of its members.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-18T07:01:52-07:00","id":141552,"title":"","content":"Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Words Lost in the Storm</b><br /> Only the Lawgiver knows how to sway the hearts of the people. The Solar may activate this charm when using social influence on an audience. The Solar selects an Intimacy and for the rest of the scene, only she may use that Intimacy to influence the audience. Anyone else who attempts to use it treats the audience as if they did not have the chosen Intimacy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T06:26:58-07:00","id":142244,"title":"","content":"Archery:<br /> <br /> <b>Unerring Memorial Arrow</b><br /> Having tested her accuracy against her target once, the Solar's aim becomes truer. After the Solar makes a successful attack against a target and deals damage, the Solar may repeat that exact attack during her next action, using the same charms, gambits, techniques and merits. All dice that come up as a 9 when rolling to attack count as two successes. The Solar can repeat the attack again to make 8s and 7s count as two successes as well. However, the Solar's successes on the attack and damage rolls cannot exceed the successes of the original attack being copied.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T07:07:37-07:00","id":143403,"title":"","content":"Resistance:<br /> <br /> <b>Blood and Venom Antidote</b><br /> This charm allows the Solar to adapt his body against poisons and diseases. If the Solar successfully resists a poison or disease, the cost to use the Resistance excellency against that same poison or diseases is reduced by one mote for the rest of the scene. This charm's effects are cumulative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T06:16:12-07:00","id":144415,"title":"","content":"Larceny:<br /> <br /> <b>Lost Treasure's Sorrows</b><br /> The Solar takes from her victims and leaves them with a burning obsession. The Solar may activate this charm when stealing or conning someone out of one of their possessions. The item's owner immediately gains an Minor Tie towards the item. If the owner already has a Tie to the item, its strength is increased by one rank. If the owner has a Defining Tie towards the item, all of the owner's other Defining Intimacies are reduced to a Major Intimacy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T08:37:27-07:00","id":144499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=144415#post144415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Larceny:<br /> <br /> <b>Lost Treasure's Sorrows</b><br /> The Solar takes from her victims and leaves them with a burning obsession. The Solar may activate this charm when stealing or conning someone out of one of their possessions. The item's owner immediately gains an Minor Tie towards the item. If the owner already has a Tie to the item, its strength is increased by one rank. If the owner has a Defining Tie towards the item, all of the owner's other Defining Intimacies are reduced to a Major Intimacy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooh, nice.<br /> <br /> <i>Of course</i>, it's not always the case that you want to steal something and get away with it. Sometimes you want to steal something in order to bait someone into a trap, even if the thing you stole wasn't actually that important to them.<br /> <br /> This way you could steal someone's fountain pen and use it to blackmail them into signing a contract, or steal their car keys and be sure they'll chase after you into that dark alley.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T08:39:32-07:00","id":144502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=142244#post142244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Archery:<br /> <br /> <b>Unerring Memorial Arrow</b><br /> Having tested her accuracy against her target once, the Solar's aim becomes truer. After the Solar makes a successful attack against a target and deals damage, the Solar may repeat that exact attack during her next action, using the same charms, gambits, techniques and merits. All dice that come up as a 9 when rolling to attack count as two successes. The Solar can repeat the attack again to make 8s and 7s count as two successes as well. However, the Solar's successes on the attack and damage rolls cannot exceed the successes of the original attack being copied.</div> </div> </div> </div>A reversal of that Investigation Charm. Instead of gaining a better chance of success after a failure, the Solar gains a better chance of success after succeeding the first time. Learning from previous victories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T08:39:50-07:00","id":144503,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I wrote it so that if you want to grift someone and can't find a hook, you can just steal something from them and use that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T05:26:43-07:00","id":145570,"title":"","content":"Athletics:<br /> <br /> <b>Thundering Comet Charge</b><br /> The Solar's steps leave thundering winds and crushing whirlpools in their wake and halts the Solar's competition. The Solar may activate this charm when rolling for a contest of speed. All opponents who are behind the Solar by up to (Solar's Athletics) successes behind the Solar take a penalty to their next roll equal to the Solar's Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T05:46:07-07:00","id":145583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=145570#post145570\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Athletics:<br /> <br /> <b>Thundering Comet Charge</b><br /> The Solar's steps leave thundering winds and crushing whirlpools in their wake and halts the Solar's competition. The Solar may activate this charm when rolling for a contest of speed. All opponents who are behind the Solar by up to (Solar's Athletics) successes behind the Solar take a penalty to their next roll equal to the Solar's Essence.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno. I'd prefer this to be the result of going faster than the Solar normally does, or a consequence of going slower.<br /> <br /> See, secondary effects like this happen when something goes so fast that they disrupt the environment around them. But if this effect is required for that, then the Solar is normally capable of traveling at super-sonic speeds without creating sonic booms. Which is one of those impossibly graceful things that a Solar can do.<br /> <br /> But if a Solar is going to forsake grace and do the equivalent of stomping his feet as he runs, then it seems like he should be moving slower. Because his actions are no longer purely about moving efficiently. Just as you would expect a normal runner to move more slowly if he was deliberately trying to make as much noise with his footfalls as possible.<br /> <br /> On the other side is that sonic-boom Adjoran Charm from Second Edition. The Infernal dashes faster for one action, <i>and </i>creates a sonic-boom. It's a powerful two-effects-in-one Charm, but we've been told to expect Charm progressions to spike in power around Essence 3 and Essence 5. This Charm might be one of those spikes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T07:01:29-07:00","id":146687,"title":"","content":"Brawl:<br /> <br /> <b>Stone Serpent Fist</b><br /> The Solar's fist seamlessly flows between defense and offense in preparation for her next attack. If the Solar successfully parries a close-range attack with her unarmed fist and uses her next action to grapple her attacker, she may choose to reroll all 6s until they come up as a success or failure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T06:15:08-07:00","id":147792,"title":"","content":"Resistance:<br /> <br /> <b>Ward of the Divine Shield</b><br /> The weapons of men know better than to test themselves against the Lawgiver's power. Upon activating this charm, the Solar chooses a weapon category and a tag. When faced with a decisive attack from a weapon of that class and from an attack that capitalizes on the selected tag, the Solar adds her Essence rating to her Hardness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T07:20:11-07:00","id":148679,"title":"","content":"Linguistics: <br /> <br /> <b>Harmonious Mediation Technique</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm when mediating social influence as a neutral party between two or more characters who do not speak a common language.<br /> <br /> First, the Solar learns the languages used by all parties. This effect is specific to the context of the negotiations, and thus only works while this charm is active. This negates all penalties due to communicating in different languages. If the Solar already speaks these languages, either because of a Merit, Charm or other ability, the Solar's knowledge smooths out misunderstandings and imprecision. All parties involved in the social influence may choose to reroll 6s until they come up as successes or failures. <br /> <br /> Second, the Solar may select an Intimacy common to all parties. Each party's attachment to that Intimacy increases by one rank. If a party already possesses that Intimacy as a Defining Intimacy, they become unable to spend Willpower to reject social influences based on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T06:39:12-07:00","id":149360,"title":"","content":"Ride:<br /> <br /> <b>Ascending Sun's Sustenance</b><br /> The Lawgiver's mount is inexhaustible. So long as the Solar keeps motes committed to this charm, her chosen mount cannot suffer from natural hunger or fatigue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T06:29:59-07:00","id":150274,"title":"","content":"Resistance:<br /> <br /> <b>Blood and Wine Festival</b><br /> This charm supplements a roll to win a contest of endurance, either of pain or intoxication. For the duration of a contest of pain endurance, the Solar may subtract her wound penalty from the mote cost of any Resistance charm she uses to resist further damage. For the duration of a contest of intoxication, the Solar may subtract the highest number of threshold successes obtained by one of her opponents since her previous roll from her the activation cost of the Resistance Excellency.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T06:14:50-07:00","id":151237,"title":"","content":"Larceny:<br /> <br /> <b>Faith in Golden Lies</b><br /> The Solar's mark refuses to believe that she has been duped. This charm supplements a forgery action. Once the forgery is in the hands of its intended mark, any failed attempt to convince the mark that the forgery is a fake instead reinforces an Intimacy that the object is real. Calculate threshold successes towards instilling this Intimacy by subtracting the number of successes rolled from the mark's Resolve.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T07:14:07-07:00","id":152478,"title":"","content":"Investigation:<br /> <br /> <b>Deeper Sins Unearthed</b><br /> This charm supplements an attempt to investigate a crime scene or interview a victim. If the investigation is successful, this charm alerts the Solar if the crime being investigated is part of a larger crime. For example, a theft might be part of a conspiracy to blackmail someone, while a mugging could be an assassination. This charm does not reveal the details of the larger crime, but it does give the Solar insight into other crimes which should be investigated for more information.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T14:19:44-07:00","id":152966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=114675#post114675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Craft of Love</b><br /> The Solar's passion drives his artifice. When rolling to craft an object specifically for someone towards whom the Solar holds a positive Minor Tie, the Solar counts 9s as two successes. If the Intimacy is a positive Major Tie, 8s count as two successes as well and if the Intimacy is a positive Defining Tie, 7s also count as two successes.</div> </div> </div> </div>How about <b>Gracious Fellowship Bequeathal</b>? I really like the idea of crafting charms that play off of creating something specially designed for a individual. I would love to see a charm that mechanically improves crafting if the recipient of the artifact somehow proves themselves to the craftsman, channeling their success over the course of a test or trial into the creation of the artifact. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T07:06:40-07:00","id":153813,"title":"","content":"Archery:<br /> <br /> <b>Steel Talon Strike</b><br /> This charm supplements a called shot to cripple an opponent in a manner that would require significant medical skills or surgery to heal. Add the Solar's Essence to the difficulty of any Medicine roll to treat the wound.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T06:30:07-07:00","id":154754,"title":"","content":"Athletics<br /> <br /> <b>Mountain-Strolling Style</b><br /> The Solar walks up a mountain as easily as she walks down a street. So long as this charm is active, the Solar can climb anything using only her feet. This frees up her hands to wield weapons or perform some other task.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T06:51:01-07:00","id":155618,"title":"","content":"Melee:<br /> <br /> <b>Fifth Dawn's Ascension</b><br /> Upon activating this charm, the Solar selects a target. If she attacks this target and misses, the Solar may 'bank' 1 momentum. The Solar may bank an amount of momentum equal to her Melee rating and gains any banked momentum when she successfully hits her target. The momentum bank is reduced to zero if the Solar attacks anyone other than her target.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T08:05:45-07:00","id":155632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=155618#post155618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Melee:<br /> <br /> <b>Fifth Dawn's Ascension</b><br /> Upon activating this charm, the Solar selects a target. If she attacks this target and misses, the Solar may 'bank' 1 momentum. The Solar may bank an amount of momentum equal to her Melee rating and gains any banked momentum when she successfully hits her target. The momentum bank is reduced to zero if the Solar attacks anyone other than her target.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Interesting. <br /> <br /> But did it have to be &amp;#@# Melee?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T08:31:16-07:00","id":155646,"title":"","content":"Yeah. I roll 2d10 to pick a Solar Caste and an Ability at random and try to come up with something. Rolling anything combat-related absolutely sucks on account of my having not seen the combat engine, but that's part of the exercise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T07:33:45-07:00","id":156498,"title":"","content":"Brawl:<br /> <br /> <b>Fort-Breaker Fist</b><br /> If the Solar is aware of a target behind cover, including complete cover, she may use this charm to attack and damage the cover. If this attack deals (10 - Solar's Essence) damage to the cover, the Solar may immediately roll to repeat her attack against her target. This second attack uses the same charms and merits as the first, so all powers used must be applicable to both the cover and the target. However, the target does not benefit from any cover bonuses to defend against the second attack. In addition, the Solar's first attack against the cover generates appropriate momentum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T06:39:06-07:00","id":157774,"title":"","content":"Performance:<br /> <br /> <b>Festival of Hopes and Dreams</b><br /> The Solar sings a song which appeals to one of a specific listener's positive Intimacies and rolls Charisma + Performance. If the roll overcomes the target's Resolve, the strength of that Intimacy is increased by one rank so long as the Solar keeps singing. If that Intimacy is already defining, then the target cannot spend Willpower to resist social influences which are based on that Intimacy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T06:20:35-07:00","id":158967,"title":"","content":"Survival: <br /> <br /> <b>Supreme Huntsman's Trail</b><br /> The Solar takes a moment to smell the wind and listen to the wilds. When she emerges from her meditation, she gains an instinctive knowledge of the most dangerous natural predator within Essence X 10 miles and may immediately begin tracking it, even if she has no visible trail to follow. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T07:28:28-07:00","id":159976,"title":"","content":"Lore:<br /> <br /> <b>Philosopher-King's Wisdom</b><br /> The Solar knows the truth of the world and will not stray from it. Whenever someone attempts to use social influence on the Solar and makes arguments which the Solar knows to be factually false, the Solar may defend against the influence as if she possessed a relevant Defining Principle. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T06:14:38-07:00","id":160755,"title":"","content":"I'm starting to think my dice are loaded, which is odd, because I have ten of them and I don't always use the same ones. Anyway...<br /> <br /> Resistance: <br /> <b>Inevitable Steel Tide Approach</b><br /> Whenever the Solar would successfully dodge or parry an attack from medium range or farther, she can activate this charm to retroactively reduce her relevant defense value to 0 and take the full brunt of the attack. The Solar gains momentum equal to the damage she successfully soaked. In addition, if the Solar moves towards her attacker during her next action, she may apply the amount of damage she has suffered as a mote discount when activating an Excellency relevant to her combat movement dice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T06:28:43-07:00","id":161615,"title":"","content":"Survival<br /> <br /> <b>Trail of Thorns and Fangs</b><br /> The safety of the wilds is fleeting at best, and the Solar knows how to exploit it. Whenever a Solar successfully navigates a dangerous area of the wilds and avoids environmental hazards and animals, she may activate this charm. Anyone who attempts to follow the Solar's trail and fails is automatically beset by an environmental hazard or a pack of wild animals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T10:18:04-07:00","id":161840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=161615#post161615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Survival<br /> <br /> <b>Trail of Thorns and Fangs</b><br /> The safety of the wilds is fleeting at best, and the Solar knows how to exploit it. Whenever a Solar successfully navigates a dangerous area of the wilds and avoids environmental hazards and animals, she may activate this charm. Anyone who attempts to follow the Solar's trail and fails is automatically beset by an environmental hazard or a pack of wild animals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice.<br /> <br /> The last two, as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-08T07:21:43-07:00","id":162406,"title":"","content":"Archery<br /> <br /> <b>Baneful Hunting Flight</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm when rolling an attack against a target that has moved away from the Solar during their last action. If the attack is successful, the Solar gains additional momentum equal to how many range bands away the target is from the Solar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T06:43:03-07:00","id":163521,"title":"","content":"Integrity<br /> <br /> <b>Vengeful Champion's Suspicions</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm when she discovers that she was influenced into undertaking a given course of action or espousing a specific belief under false pretenses. So long as the Solar commits motes to this charm, she may reject any social influence based on the Intimacy that was used to deceive her without spending willpower, even if she is unable to call upon another intimacy to guide her actions. This charm automatically ends when the Solar makes reparation for any misdeeds she may have committed while under deception, or when she obtains appropriate vengeance against whoever deceived her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T04:38:37-07:00","id":164705,"title":"","content":"Athletics:<br /> <br /> <b>Loot-Bearing Mule Prana</b><br /> The Solar as able to carry an infinite weight of items, so long as they are small and light enough that the Solar can hold them in one hand. The volume of items might prevent the Solar from accessing tight spaces, but does not otherwise penalize her actions or movements.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T07:31:24-07:00","id":165893,"title":"","content":"Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Thought-Shaping Index</b><br /> The Solar stands at the heart of the crowd and points to one of them, bestowing upon them a title of her choice, such as 'prince,' 'general,' 'merchant,' 'murderer,' 'criminal,' or any other title the Solar considers appropriate. The Solar rolls Manipulation and an appropriate ability and benefits from any positive Intimacy that witnesses might have towards her. If the social influence succeeds, all who see the Solar's praise - or condemnation - of the target immediately begin treating the target according to the title given to him, even if it is false and the target is unable to bear its responsibilities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T08:13:22-07:00","id":165929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=164705#post164705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Athletics:<br /> <br /> <b>Loot-Bearing Mule Prana</b><br /> The Solar as able to carry an infinite weight of items, so long as they are small and light enough that the Solar can hold them in one hand. The volume of items might prevent the Solar from accessing tight spaces, but does not otherwise penalize her actions or movements.</div> </div> </div> </div>You do realize this allows you to have a videogame wallet, right? Wherein you carry thousands or millions of gold coins?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=165893#post165893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Thought-Shaping Index</b><br /> The Solar stands at the heart of the crowd and points to one of them, bestowing upon them a title of her choice, such as 'prince,' 'general,' 'merchant,' 'murderer,' 'criminal,' or any other title the Solar considers appropriate. The Solar rolls Manipulation and an appropriate ability and benefits from any positive Intimacy that witnesses might have towards her. If the social influence succeeds, all who see the Solar's praise - or condemnation - of the target immediately begin treating the target according to the title given to him, even if it is false and the target is unable to bear its responsibilities.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IZ56Zh5ciYU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IZ56Zh5ciYU\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IZ56Zh5ciYU\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IZ56Zh5ciYU </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T09:11:56-07:00","id":165988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=165929#post165929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You do realize this allows you to have a videogame wallet, right? Wherein you carry thousands or millions of gold coins?</div> </div> </div> </div>I wrote it specifically because of Skyrim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T06:14:58-07:00","id":166888,"title":"","content":"Integrity:<br /> <br /> <b>Nightmare-Slaying Determination</b><br /> Whenever someone fails a Threaten action against the Solar without the Solar having to spend willpower to resist it, the Solar's resolve increases by one. If the Solar reaches her maximum Resolve cap because of this charm, she no longer needs to spend willpower to resist Threaten actions so long as she can call upon an Intimacy to defend herself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T06:41:36-07:00","id":167845,"title":"","content":"Sail: <br /> <br /> <b>Daring Adventurer's Wind</b><br /> This charm supplement's a Solar's attempt to plot a journey through sea, land or sky. If the Solar rolls the required number of successes, nothing happens. However, if the Solar achieves threshold successes, she may plot a second course. This course is filled with a number of obstacles such as environmental hazards, natural disasters and hostile forces equal to the number of threshold successes rolled, up to a maximum of the Solar's Essence. So long as the Solar follows the more dangerous course, she may deduct the total number of obstacles from the cost of using the Sail Excellency. In addition, her total travel time is divided by the number of obstacles along her course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T06:49:38-07:00","id":168858,"title":"","content":"Larceny:<br /> <br /> <b>Golden Bauble Distraction</b><br /> The Solar uses this misdirection as cover for her crimes. This charm supplements an attempt at social influence to imply that one of the target's beloved possessions is about to be damaged, stolen or is otherwise in need of focused attention. If the social influence is successful, the target takes a penalty equal to his intimacy towards the beloved possession to any attempt to notice that one of her other possessions has been pickpocketed or stolen. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T06:12:42-07:00","id":169738,"title":"","content":"War: <br /> <br /> <b>Banner of the Victorious Legion</b><br /> The Solar may erect a number of banners bearing her name or emblem equal to her War rating on the battle field. So long as all these banners are standings, all battle groups under the Solar's command possess a Principle towards victory and following the Solar's orders which may be used to resist intimidation and maintain morale. The Principle is minor if there are 1 or 2 banners up, major if there are 3 or 4 and defining if there are 5.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T06:43:01-07:00","id":170673,"title":"","content":"Athletics:<br /> <br /> <b>Holistic Athleticism Synergy</b><br /> An athlete's body is a healthy one. While the Solar is engaged in strenuous activity such as racing or weightlifting, she may substitute Resistance for Athletics when rolling to resist poison, disease or deprivation. If the Solar also possesses the Resistance Excellency, she may roll both Resistance and Athletics and retain the higher of the two rolls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T06:58:28-07:00","id":170679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=170673#post170673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Athletics:<br /> <br /> <b>Holistic Athleticism Synergy</b><br /> An athlete's body is a healthy one. While the Solar is engaged in strenuous activity such as racing or weightlifting, she may substitute Resistance for Athletics when rolling to resist poison, disease or deprivation. If the Solar also possesses the Resistance Excellency, she may roll both Resistance and Athletics and retain the higher of the two rolls.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty cool, but would you pay for the cost of both excellencies if you use them simultaneously?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T06:19:43-07:00","id":171600,"title":"","content":"I'm not too sure. My first instinct is that you'd only pay for the Excellencies once, but I'm not too sure how to handle dice caps. <br /> <br /> Dodge:<br /> <br /> <b>Flesh and Shadow Phantom</b><br /> The Solar is struck in half by her enemy's blow, but her defeat is but a phantom; her form has become an afterimage with mass. The Solar activates this charm in response to an enemy's attack. If the Solar fails to dodge the attack, whatever amount of momentum her enemy would gain from the attack is reduced by 1. If the Solar benefits from the effects of this charm again during her next action, the total momentum her enemy would gain further decreases by 1. This effect is cumulative up to the Solar's Essence. Using this charm against a different attacker does not break this chain and the Solar can maintain multiple chains at the same time, but successfully dodging or soaking all the damage of an attack does. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T05:57:02-07:00","id":172693,"title":"","content":"Archery:<br /> <br /> <b>Broken Arrow</b><br /> The Solar supports her allies with her archery. This charm supports an attack against an enemy who is engaged in close-range combat against one of the Solar's allies and possesses a momentum advantage over that ally. If the attack is successful, the Solar's ally can immediately take a movement action to escape, even if it would normally be impossible for her to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T06:26:58-07:00","id":174039,"title":"","content":"Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Unknowable Poetic Harmony</b><br /> The Solar writes a poem of sublime rhythm and rhyme. However, her writing remain incomplete and no other can finish it. This charm is a written social influence towards finishing the Solar's poem and must be aimed at a specific target. If the original roll is successful, the target gains a minor intimacy towards finishing the poem. Every time the target returns to the poem, the Solar rolls to strengthen the target's intimacy towards finishing the poem. These subsequent rolls cannot benefit from the Solar's other charms, but the Solar automatically adds a number of successes equal to her Essence to the roll. The intimacy created by this charm is often used to convince the target to work on the poem and abandon their usual duties and responsibilities. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T06:24:55-07:00","id":175181,"title":"","content":"Brawl:<br /> <br /> <b>Face of the Crowd</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm when she is fighting before a crowd of people who hold a positive intimacy towards her. It remains active as long as the Solar uses only her unarmed punch or kick. Whenever the Solar makes a successful attack against an opponent who is armed, that opponent loses momentum equal to the crowd's intimacy towards the Solar (1 for minor, 2 for major, 3 for defining). <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">I regret nothing. </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T06:34:53-07:00","id":175964,"title":"","content":"Melee:<br /> <br /> <b>Harmony of Arrow and Spear </b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm after running out of ammunition for an Archery or Thrown weapon and drawing a Melee weapon. Immediately before the Solar's next close-range opponent in the Join Battle queue takes action, the Solar can make a Melee attack against any opponent at close range.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T13:59:20-07:00","id":176393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=175964#post175964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Melee:<br /> <br /> <b>Harmony of Arrow and Spear </b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm after running out of ammunition for an Archery or Thrown weapon and drawing a Melee weapon. Immediately before the Solar's next close-range opponent in the Join Battle queue takes action, the Solar can make a Melee attack against any opponent at close range.</div> </div> </div> </div>This isn't a Solar Charm. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T14:25:27-07:00","id":176425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuddenThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=176393#post176393\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This isn't a Solar Charm.</div> </div> </div> </div>Elaborate?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T14:38:24-07:00","id":176434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gayo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=176425#post176425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Elaborate?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Under the current circumstances I've said as much as I am inclined to. <br /> <br /> This is not a Charm I would advise or consider for Solar characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T17:51:23-07:00","id":176591,"title":"","content":"I was inspired by that thing where the guy empties his flintlock and then throws it away before drawing his sword. Eloquent, I know.<br /> <br /> Anyway, these aren't part of my normal quota, but I've already forgotten some charms that I wanted to write and I would rather not do that again.<br /> <br /> Melee: <br /> <br /> <b>Steel River's Current</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm when her attack misses. She may redirect her attack to any structure or environmental feature within close range. The Solar retains her original attack roll and charm activations and resolves the attack again against her new target's defense. <br /> <br /> Socialize: <br /> <br /> <b>Unity of Ten Thousand Wills</b><br /> The Solar gathers into her entourage a crowd of people who share a specific intimacy. When the crowd is present to bear witness to the Solar's attempt at social influence, the Solar may activate this Charm and roll Charisma + Socialize against her target's Resolve. If the Solar is successful, her target may not benefit from any Intimacy that goes against the Intimacy that unites the crowd. This effect lasts until the end of the scene, or until the crowd disperses. <br /> <br /> Craft: <br /> <br /> <b>Gifter's Unwavering Spirit</b><br /> When she crafts an item, the Solar may dedicate it to an intended recipient. If anyone succesfully claims the item from its rightful owner through theft, force or purchase, the item is immediately destroyed. Mundane items turn to ash and rust and structures rot and collapse. Artifacts explode, dealing damage to anyone in medium range. The destruction of a manse anointed by this charm is a truly cataclysmic event. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T18:26:53-07:00","id":176617,"title":"","content":"I like Unity of Ten Thousand Wills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T06:14:04-07:00","id":176934,"title":"","content":"Performance:<br /> <br /> <b>Mirror and Mask Condemnation</b><br /> Having discovered her target's secret, the Solar performs a scathing parody of it. This charm supplements a social influence to erode an intimacy which the target tries to keep secret from others. The Solar acts out a play shaming that intimacy and for the rest of the play, she gains a number of equal successes to her Essence rating to rolls to erode the target's intimacy. In addition, if the Solar successfully lowers the strength of the target's intimacy, the target immediately also gains a minor principle of shame towards that intimacy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T06:59:18-07:00","id":177891,"title":"","content":"Brawl: <br /> <br /> <b>Thunder Fist Defenestration</b><br /> If the Solar successfully throws or knockbacks her opponent through a structure or window, she may replace her damage with a heavy weapon's damage rating. In addition, if this charm is used outside combat or during the Solar's first action in combat, the Solar may immediately roll Strength + Presence to intimidate anyone who witnesses the attack, adding a number of automatic successes equal to her Essence rating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T07:47:08-07:00","id":177916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=177891#post177891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Brawl:<br /> <br /> <b>Thunder Fist Defenestration</b><br /> If the Solar successfully throws or knockbacks her opponent through a structure or window, she may replace her damage with a heavy weapon's damage rating. In addition, if this charm is used outside combat or during the Solar's first action in combat, the Solar may immediately roll Strength + Presence to intimidate anyone who witnesses the attack, adding a number of automatic successes equal to her Essence rating.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you really think players need more incentive to throw people through windows?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T07:04:40-07:00","id":178901,"title":"","content":"Resistance: <br /> <br /> <b>Depthless Ocean Cup</b><br /> This charm allows the Solar to eat and drink in infinite amounts, far beyond the capacity of a mere human. So long as the charm is active, the Solar's stomach is never full. This charm does not protect the Solar against poisons, but it does protect her from mundane impurities of such things as stale water or rotten food. This charm is often used to deal with floods, but it can also be used to intimidate spirit. Any spirit related to food or water whose domain is consumed by the Solar - such as a river spirit or a field god - gains a defining intimacy of horror towards the Solar which lasts until the spirit's purview returns to normal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T06:25:01-07:00","id":179620,"title":"","content":"Resistance: <br /> <br /> <b>Molting Dragon Prana</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm whenever she is fighting without a suit of armour she usually wears. The costs of all the Solar's Resistance charms are reduced by her usual armour's weight (1 for light armour, 2 for medium armour and 3 for heavy armour).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T07:06:22-07:00","id":180763,"title":"","content":"Ride: <br /> <br /> <b>Guarding Knight Cavalry</b><br /> The Solar may activate this Charm whenever one of her allies outside close range is attacked. This charm allows the Solar to make a movement action to move next to her ally and to immediately make a Defend Other action to protect her ally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T07:07:46-07:00","id":181909,"title":"","content":"Ride:<br /> <br /> <b>Thundering Destrier-Tyrant</b><br /> While she is mounted, the Solar may use this charm to supplement an attempt to intimidate her opponent's own mount. The Solar adds a number of automatic successes equal to her Essence to the intimidation attempt and her opponent cannot calm or maintain control of her mount unless she possesses supernatural means to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T06:55:56-07:00","id":182845,"title":"","content":"Ride: <br /> <br /> <b>Five-Fold Steed Cataclysm</b><br /> The Solar stands before a natural disaster such as a tsunami, tornado, rock slide or volcanic eruption and activates this charm. The cataclysm quells and coalesces a figurehead in the form of a dragon, which serves as the Solar's mount. So long as the Solar remains mounted on the figurehead, she may control the movements and damage of the natural disaster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T07:10:46-07:00","id":183768,"title":"","content":"Performance:<br /> <br /> <b>Divine Steps' Symphony</b><br /> The Solar sings, plays an instrument or conducts an orchestra for the benefit of a dancing audience. So long as the Solar maintains the Performance, she may use her Performance Excellency any single dancer she wishes. At a higher Essence, she may use the Performance Excellency to support as many dancers as she wishes with a single activation of the Excellency per action.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T06:39:27-07:00","id":184759,"title":"","content":"Investigation:<br /> <br /> <b>Stone-Writ Pattern Insight</b><br /> Once the Solar has studied the home, workplace and social life of a suspect, as well as uncovered one of the suspect's defining intimacies, she may activate this charm to predict exactly how the suspect will react to any given event.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-01T07:05:47-07:00","id":185490,"title":"","content":"Brawl<br /> <br /> <b>Thousand Shooting Star Assault</b><br /> The Solar may reflexively activate this charm whenever she hits her opponent and successfully deals damage. If she attacks the same opponent again during her next action, she gains +1 to Accuracy and Damage. This charm can stack up to the Solar's Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-01T14:04:27-07:00","id":185783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=182845#post182845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ride:<br /> <br /> <b>Five-Fold Steed Cataclysm</b><br /> The Solar stands before a natural disaster such as a tsunami, tornado, rock slide or volcanic eruption and activates this charm. The cataclysm quells and coalesces a figurehead in the form of a dragon, which serves as the Solar's mount. So long as the Solar remains mounted on the figurehead, she may control the movements and damage of the natural disaster.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You know that part in Lord of the Rings where they're running from the Ringwraiths, and suddenly that huge horse-wave comes down the river and fucks the bad guys up? Imagine if Elrond had been riding that. Imagine if <i>Gandalf</i> had been riding that.<br /> <br /> If anything, my only objection is that this seems more like a DB charm, complete with an upgrade to let your friends ride along with you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-01T15:42:18-07:00","id":185819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ellis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=185783#post185783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anything, my only objection is that this seems more like a DB charm, complete with an upgrade to let your friends ride along with you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do agree, for all it's an awesome image. <br /> <br /> I does feel like, generally, Solars treat tsunamis as oh-so-much- good surfing with their Charms. (Or they stunt - it depends on how important or central &quot;Being a surfer who surfs the impossible to surf&quot; is to the Solar's concept). They should use Evocations to direct them and make them look all beast-y<br /> <br /> (although maybe some kind of weird hazard shaping Craft charm makes sense as well... just Ride doesn't feel proper).<br /> <br /> Although that said I like the image of the surfer who *somehow*, through his skill, controls the wave (even though it's clearly impossible! but then isn't so much that choreographs well). But that seems different to what this Charm is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-01T16:25:24-07:00","id":185834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ellis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=185783#post185783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anything, my only objection is that this seems more like a DB charm, complete with an upgrade to let your friends ride along with you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I took it to be a Charm to enable <a href=\"http://americanfolklore.net/folklore/2010/07/pecos_bill_rides_a_tornado.html\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;Pecos Bill Rides a Tornado,&quot;</a> albeit with a distinct visual flourish with the dragon head. Seems fine to me, though I can see where people may disagree.<br /> <br /> Refreshing my memory via Wikipedia, Pecos Bill can give some potential Solar material (riding a horse that had killed every other man to try, tornado-riding, shooting all but one of the stars out of the sky for the one he loved, etc.), albeit toward the goofy end in places (using snakes as lassos and whips, favorite food of dynamite, etc.).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":558,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","user":"Gaius","date":". 07-01-2014, 07:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-01T16:46:03-07:00","id":185850,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I can't remember why I wrote it. I think it had something to do with riding lesser elemental dragons, only that didn't seem awesome enough, so I switched to tsunamis and volcanic eruptions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T06:24:09-07:00","id":186239,"title":"","content":"Bureaucracy<br /> <br /> <b>Honest Greed's Omission</b><br /> The Solar may use this charm when negotiating the price of her goods. So long as her buyer possesses a positive intimacy towards the Solar and the Solar makes no direct or indirect mention of the value of her goods in any given market, the buyer may not use his own knowledge of the goods' resale value to resist the Solar's social influence. In addition, if the Solar sells her goods above their worth, this does not erode the buyer's intimacy towards her. The buyer will simply rationalize that they are at fault for negotiating poorly, or that the high price of the goods is a necessary loss leader to maintain their relationship with the Solar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T06:49:28-07:00","id":187010,"title":"","content":"Resistance<br /> <br /> <b>Shadow-Warding Bulwark</b><br /> The Solar commits one mote as a Simple action. As long as this charm is active, the Solar adds her Essence to her Soak against surprise attacks. This charm deactivates automatically the first time the Solar is hit by a surprise attack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T06:36:37-07:00","id":187920,"title":"","content":"Brawl<br /> <br /> <b>Root and Thunder Prana</b><br /> The Solar flexes her bulging muscles and craters the ground with a stomp of her feet. So long as the Solar herself does not move, she automatically gains a clash attack against any close-range opponent whose attack would knock her back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-05T06:59:09-07:00","id":188678,"title":"","content":"Dodge<br /> <br /> <b>Prism Step Redirection</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm whenever she successfully dodges an attack. The Solar can redirect the attack towards anyone in close range of her. The attack uses the same charms, techniques and dice roll, but the attacker does not need to pay for the attack twice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T06:45:03-07:00","id":189349,"title":"","content":"Socialize:<br /> <br /> <b>Silk and Diamond Stance</b><br /> The Solar dresses in a manner befitting the culture or social group which he wishes to interact with and activates this charm. So long as the charm remains active, anyone from that group or culture who interacts with the Solar cannot benefit from any intimacy of prejudice against the Solar's native culture. Negative intimacies that are specific to the Solar may still apply.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T06:44:06-07:00","id":190228,"title":"","content":"Brawl:<br /> <br /> <b>Hundred Fists Nova</b><br /> This charm can be used as a decisive attack. The Solar's fist becomes wreathed in sunfire and explodes upon contact with his opponent. The Solar first resolve this attack against every enemy within medium range of the Solar. These enemies take the attack to their momentum rather than their health. The Solar then resolves the attack against her initial target. If the attack hits, the Solar gains a number of dice of damage equal to the number of opponents who lost momentum, up to a maximum of the Solar's Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T06:53:43-07:00","id":191348,"title":"","content":"Ride:<br /> <br /> <b>Ascendant Horselord's Crown</b><br /> The majesty of the Solar's steed cows lesser beasts into submission. When the Solar activates this charm, any rider whose mount is lesser than the Solar's, either because of a difference between their mounts' natural abilities or because the Solar's own mount is bolstered by other charms, must succeed an opposed Charisma + Ride roll versus the Solar's Appearance + Ride. If the Solar succeeds, her opponent's mount gains an minor tie of fear towards the Solar's steed, which the Solar can exploit with further intimidation. If the Solar's mount is a blatantly supernatural being and the enemy's mount is mundane, the intimacy becomes major.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T06:05:09-07:00","id":192310,"title":"","content":"Ride:<br /> <br /> <b>Rainbow Path of Dreams and Harmony</b><br /> The Solar's anima explodes and wraps around her mount. This charm adds the Solar's Essence as automatic successes to all of the mount's movement rolls when jumping or dashing. In addition, the Solar's forges a horn for the mount which can be used as a weapon. Treat the horn as a heavy weapon with the lethal and piercing tags. Treat the horn as an artifact when it's used to attack structures or other obstacles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T08:24:47-07:00","id":193641,"title":"","content":"Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Essence of Words and Wind</b><br /> Upon learning this charm, the Solar invents a new language of absolute precision and clarity. The language is universal and can be understood by anyone who possesses at least one iteration of the Language Merit, but it cannot be used in casual conversation - it can only be used during negotiations. Those who speak in the language cannot knowingly deceive, either through lies, omission, or willful ignorance on their part, nor can they be misunderstood. They add a number of automatic successes equal to the Solar's Essence rating to all their social influence rolls during negotiation and can always leverage their own trustworthiness as a minor tie if the party they are negotiating with has no other intimacy to exploit. The Solar can teach this language to as many people as she wishes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T07:44:29-07:00","id":194626,"title":"","content":"Larceny:<br /> <br /> <b>Hidden Mule Technique</b><br /> The Solar leaves her ill-gotten gains in the custody of a bystander or innocent party who is unaware of the theft. The external penalty to trace the item increases by the Solar's Essence rating. In addition, any accomplice of the Solar who attempts to recover the item through any means automatically adds a number of automatic successes equal to the Solar's Essence to any relevant rolls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T13:36:16-07:00","id":194940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms#post113648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Dojo of the Mind</b><br /> The Solar plays out the results of a battle in her mind to create the best opportunity to strike. When activating this Charm, the Solar selects a target. This Charm provides the following effects:<br /> - The Solar's attacks take place only in her mind. Substitute Dexterity for Intelligence and Strength for Wits when rolling attacks and damage.<br /> - The Solar's attacks gains long range.<br /> - The Solar may defend herself and move normally, but may not attack anyone other than her current target.<br /> - The Solar cannot use lethal attacks or Gambits, but can use all her other powers. The Solar's target may defend herself normally.<br /> - The Solar's attacks gain [momentum] as normal. However, they cannot cause effects which require physical contact, such as poison and knockback.<br /> - If the Charm's target attacks the Solar, the Solar immediately gains a clash attack against her.</div> </div> </div> </div>Makes me think of the scene in the weiqi courtyard from Hero where all the combat plays out in their minds until the final attack.<br /> <br /> I just don't really know what the real benefit of using it is over just hitting your opponent. Maybe I'm not conveying that properly. You get better range, possibly better Attributes, gain [momentum] and a free clash if the opponent hits back. I get that. But are you saying you'll still be doing Bashing damage in your &quot;mental combat?&quot;<br /> <br /> \u200bI guess it seems cool, just alsovery complicated and while there are clear benefits (range, free clash, etc) I am just wondering how useful it makes it if you're not actually disabling the opponent (correct me if you actually <i>are</i>). It also feels very Sidereal, to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T07:03:32-07:00","id":195474,"title":"","content":"Larceny: <br /> <br /> <b>Box-Cracking Foresight</b><br /> The Solar prepares for her crime while scouting out the area. While casing a joint, the Solar can roll to pick locks or deactivate traps normally. Success allows her to make slight modifications to the trap or lock. The Solar can then activate this charm to &quot;suspend&quot; her success, delaying its effects until she returns to the area to commit her crime. The traps and lock work normally until the Solar returns to &quot;cash in&quot; her success. The Solar can keep a number of this charm's activations equal to her Essence at any given time, allowing her to prepare for multiple traps or locks. The Solar can voluntarily turn off this charm without returning to the scene of the desired crime, which causes the traps and locks to function normally once again. Traces of the Solar's work can be detected with a Perception + Investigation or Larceny roll with a difficulty equal to the Solar's Larceny rating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-13T06:38:44-07:00","id":196233,"title":"","content":"Bureaucracy: <br /> <br /> <b>Courageous Quill Discipline</b><br /> The Solar bolsters the hearts of her subordinates so that they do not stray from their duties. The Solar announces a policy to protect her employees from violence and retaliation. So long as this charm remains active, the Solar's subordinates increase by one rank the strength of any intimacy they can use to resist social influences meant to intimidate them into taking bureaucratic actions within the Solar's organization. If the Solar's subordinates can call upon an intimacy that is already defining, they add the Solar's Essence to their Resolve. In addition, if the Solar fights someone who has attempted to threaten or intimidate her employees, she adds the size rating of the relevant organization to her momentum after rolling join battle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-13T09:26:24-07:00","id":196338,"title":"","content":"I've got a sort-of Integrity one congealing in my head; it's centered around focusing <i>so</i> intently on something that it becomes the only result on torture or mind-reading attempts.<br /> <br /> If you've seen <i>Justice League: Unlimited</i>, there's a scene where the Question is being tortured for information, and all he gives them are bizarre conspiracy theories (such as flouride making our teeth visible on spy satellites); likewise, in <i>The Stand</i>, Tom Cullen (curse Stephanie Meyer for tarnishing the name of Cullen!), the beacon of mental health that he is, thinks &quot;M-O-O-N&quot; spells everything under the sun, so when the villain attempts to use his powers to search for Tom, all he sees is the moon. <span style=\"color:white\">Okay, that was hypnosis, but I'm counting it.</span><br /> <br /> I'm trying to think of a third example, but none are coming to mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 07-13-2014, 12:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T07:20:55-07:00","id":196758,"title":"","content":"Sail: <br /> <br /> <b>Legendary Mariner's Flag</b><br /> The Solar designs a unique flag for herself. All those who look upon the flag instantly learn the Solar's favourite port of call, as well as her profession on the ocean, whether she is a merchant, privateer, or pirate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T06:07:51-07:00","id":197850,"title":"","content":"Investigation:<br /> <br /> <b>Renowned Hunter's Taunt</b><br /> After investigating a crime scene, the Solar loudly announces her findings - as well as her intention to catch the culprit. If the criminal is still in the general area, she automatically gains a defining tie of rivalry towards the Solar and wishes to make her regret her arrogance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":54,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","user":"Tiresias","date":". 07-15-2014, 09:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T06:42:14-07:00","id":198886,"title":"","content":"Survival: <br /> <br /> <b>Bounty of Land and Thorns</b><br /> The Solar adapts to her surroundings in order to survive. So long as this charm is active, the Solar can subsist off the elemental nature of whatever Direction she happens to be in. In the West, salt water can satisfy her thirst and hunger. In the North, she can eat snow as if it were a feast. In the South, she can feed by inhaling flames. In the East, she can survive on a diet of poisoned plants and animals. In the Centre, she can eat ground rocks and dirt. A second purchase of this charm at a higher Essence allows her to use this charm to affect groups.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T08:05:53-07:00","id":200038,"title":"","content":"Sail: <br /> <br /> <b>Storm-Binding Hand</b><br /> The Solar masters both seas and storm. The Solar can use this charm to turn any weather-related penalties to naval actions into a bonus instead. This bonus counts as dice added by charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T06:40:30-07:00","id":201046,"title":"","content":"Socialize: <br /> <br /> <b>Courtly Veil Admonition</b><br /> The Solar may use this charm against someone who she has seen practicing a cultural tradition, but who does not hold a positive intimacy towards that tradition. The Solar exposes the target's hypocrisy. For the rest of the scene, all witnesses to the Solar's condemnation gain a minor tie of suspicion towards the target and if the Solar and the target both use social influence to sway a crowd, the Solar gains a number of automatic successes equal to her Essence rating on all her rolls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-19T06:32:52-07:00","id":202026,"title":"","content":"Awareness: <br /> <br /> <b>Sagacious Battle Sense</b><br /> The Solar's battle experience allows her to detect her enemies through killing intent and command the flow of battle accordingly. Whenever the Solar spots a hidden enemy, she gains an amount of momentum equal to the net successes rolled. In addition, whenever the Solar successfully defends against a surprise attack, she gains one momentum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T06:38:31-07:00","id":202865,"title":"","content":"War:<br /> <br /> <b>Empire-Crushing Defense</b><br /> The Solar's forces excel at defensive battles. If a battle group under the Solar's command has a major positive tie to the land it is fighting on, it adds the Solar's Essence to its defense. If the battle group has a positive tie instead, it also adds the Solar's Essence to its soak.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T06:35:26-07:00","id":203775,"title":"","content":"Investigation: <br /> <br /> <b>False Weasel Entrapment</b><br /> The Solar publicly accuses someone of being a criminal. The accusations are false, nothing more than a masquerade for the real criminal. So long as the accused remains the target of suspicion, the real culprit gains a major tie against committing crimes. This allows the Solar to continue her investigation using the information she already has without fear of other people becoming victimized.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T06:39:23-07:00","id":204902,"title":"","content":"Medicine: <br /> <br /> <b>Broken Flesh Rehabilitation</b><br /> Some injuries are beyond the skills of any surgeon, but a Solar is never truly helpless. This charm allows the Solar to help someone get used to a crippling injury. After one week of rehabilitation, the patient is no longer subject to penalties due to the injury.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T07:11:49-07:00","id":206051,"title":"","content":"Performance: <br /> <br /> <b>Festival of Heaven and Earth</b><br /> The Solar launches into a song and makes a prayer roll. Every terrestrial god within (Solar's Essence X 10) miles whose Resolve is lower than that the Solar's successes immediately manifests before the Solar's stage. These gods cannot benefit from intimacies or spend willpower to resist the effect. Furthermore, the Solar can beckon forth one celestial god, who does benefit from intimacies to resist the prayer and can spend willpower to resist the effect. The gods who are present at the Solar's performance must grant any request made to them my members of the Solar's audience to the best of their ability as if it were a prayer. Gods who cannot immediately answer all the requests made of them may queue their requests and address them when they have the time and resource, but requests made during the festival take priority over all other prayers. This charm lasts for one scene, or until the Solar ends her performance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T06:16:12-07:00","id":206962,"title":"","content":"Thrown: <br /> <br /> <b>Steel Rain Defense</b><br /> The Solar hurls her spear into the sky, where it disappears, waiting. After activating this charm, the Solar may make a clash attack against anyone who attempts to move within close range of her using Thrown. This charm lasts for one action.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-25T06:28:42-07:00","id":208225,"title":"","content":"Melee: <br /> <br /> <b>Shell-Cracking Stab</b><br /> This charm allows the Solar to disrupt her opponent's defenses after a successful attack. The opponent's Parry Defense is reduced by half the Solar's Essence and the opponent loses the benefits of the Shield tag. This charm lasts for one action. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T06:52:35-07:00","id":209287,"title":"","content":"Integrity:<br /> <br /> <b>Indomitable Daystar's Orbit</b><br /> It is for the Sun alone to rule the Heavens. Whenever a Sidereal uses Astrology to curse a Solar and fails, the curse is pulled into the Solar's own legend and becomes a blessing instead. This charm may or may not work on Getimian Alchemy, depending on what it does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T15:21:24-07:00","id":209544,"title":"","content":"So I looked over a Final Fantasy 15 trailer recently and had a thought; would it be out of place, based on what we know currently, for a Solar to have a charm building off of Call the Blade that allows him to teleport to the location of his weapon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/834-hk-87","name":"HK-87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T07:10:39-07:00","id":210129,"title":"","content":"That seems like a Sidereal charm more than anything. <br /> <br /> Investigation: <br /> <br /> <b>Wretched Deviance Insight</b><br /> The Solar can use this charm to infer one of a criminal's intimacies by studying one of their crimes, even if it is not directly related to their motive to commit the crime. The Solar rolls Wits + Investigation. One success reveals a minor intimacy, three successes reveal a major intimacy and five or more successes reveal a defining intimacy. This charm cannot reveal specific intimacies that would immediately the culprit's identity, but interprets them as a broader intimacy. For example, it would reveal a criminal's intimacy towards their mother rather than their intimacy towards Mnemon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T06:14:27-07:00","id":211141,"title":"","content":"Investigation: <br /> <br /> <b>Reconstruction of Lost Memories</b><br /> This charm allows a Solar to use telltale clues to imagine a the exact layout of a crime scene that was erased by the passage of time. After using this charm, the Solar knows exactly what the scene looked like exactly after the crime and can investigate the imagined room as if it were real.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T06:58:27-07:00","id":212420,"title":"","content":"Brawl: <br /> <br /> <b>Hundred Flowing Rivers Defense</b><br /> The Solar takes a defensive posture and expands her awareness. Whenever the Solar parries a close-range attack, she gains one momentum. Every attack she parries after the first grants an additional point of momentum, cumulative up to the Solar's Essence. In addition, if the Solar performs a decisive attack on an opponent whose attack she has parried during her previous action, she treats her opponent's momentum as if it were the lowest of all the close-range opponents surrounding her, regardless of its actual value.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-30T07:02:24-07:00","id":213514,"title":"","content":"Thrown: <br /> <br /> <b>Thousand Leaves Misdirection</b><br /> This charm supplements a Thrown surprise attack. If the attack fails, it still manages to distract the target. Until the target's next action, all surprise attacks against him gain a number of bonus dice equal to the Solar's Essence, and any successful attack against the target grants one additional point of momentum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-31T06:01:29-07:00","id":214578,"title":"","content":"Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Excision of False Meanings</b><br /> This charm supplements a Solar's attempt to prevent a group of people from using certain words or concepts. If the attempt is successful, the Solar may choose one intimacy related to the banned language. For all intents and purposes, members of the group who possess that intimacy treat it as if it were one degree less.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":54,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","user":"Tiresias","date":". 07-31-2014, 09:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T05:53:25-07:00","id":215789,"title":"","content":"Performance: <br /> <br /> <b>Lonely Night Cantata</b><br /> The Solar's voice drowns out all others. So long as this charm remains active, all actions that take place within earshot of the Solar and require auditory stimuli suffer from an external penalty equal to the Solar's Essence. This includes all verbal social influences, as well as supernatural powers, such as the charms of the Silver-Voiced Nightingale style and the powers of the angyalka.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T06:29:17-07:00","id":216716,"title":"","content":"Thrown: <br /> <br /> <b>Mundane Arsenal Refinement</b><br /> The Solar can gain munitions from whatever she has on hand. Whenever the Solar needs a thrown weapon, she may grab a random nearby object that qualifies as a light weapon. The weapon has the Short Range and Blunt tags. It also gains a number of additional weapon tags equal to the Solar's Essence. The Solar chooses which tags to add when learning this charm and when her Essence increases. The choice is permanent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T07:15:06-07:00","id":217383,"title":"","content":"Stealth: <br /> <br /> <b>Sunset Shadow Venom</b><br /> This charm supplements a surprise attack and numbs its damage so that the target does not notice the attack or its effect until it is too late. If the attack is successful, the target loses one momentum at the start of her action. If the charm is used to supplement a decisive attack, the target instead takes an additional -1 wound penalty. This charm lasts for a number of the target's actions equal to the Solar's Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T06:53:59-07:00","id":218113,"title":"","content":"Performance: <br /> <br /> <b>Infinite Cornucopia Sonata</b><br /> The Solar organizes a great festival to the harvest, trade, crafting, fertility, health, mining, fishing or any other local activity. This festival may last for a number of weeks equal to the Solar's Essence rating. So long as the Solar personally performs at least once a day, all those participating in the festival add the Solar's Essence as automatic successes to their relevant rolls. This charm also ensures that competitions of any kind between participants of the festival will not lead to any form of negative intimacies. The festival has lingering effects that last for the rest of the season and make things slightly easier or more convenient for the locals. Harvests are more bountiful, merchants are more likely to visit the village, children are born healthier and so forth. This charm can only be used once per season in any given town. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T06:15:13-07:00","id":218991,"title":"","content":"Presence: <br /> <br /> <b>Enduring God-King Order</b><br /> This charm can be used to supplement an action to instill an intimacy into someone. Whenever someone attempts to erode the target's intimacy or get them to act against that intimacy, the Solar may reflexively roll Charisma + Presence, adding a number of automatic successes equal to the Solar's Essence, to counter the social influence. The Solar's roll cannot benefit from the Presence Excellency or other charms. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:47:28-07:00","id":220198,"title":"","content":"Thrown: <br /> <br /> <b>Blind Hailstorm Fang</b><br /> The Solar unleashes a flurry of blades into the darkness, ferreting out hidden foes. This charm allows the Solar to make a Thrown attack against all hidden opponents in the area, even if the Solar is not aware of them. All of the targets must defend against the attack, but if multiple opponents are hit, the full attack is only resolved against the opponent with the lowest DV.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-07T06:57:32-07:00","id":220984,"title":"","content":"Melee: <br /> <br /> <b>Titan-Slaying Assault</b><br /> When the Solar successfully attacks an opponent with a greater Essence rating than her own, she gains additional momentum equal to the difference between her opponent's Essence rating and her own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T06:52:21-07:00","id":222062,"title":"","content":"Investigation: <br /> <br /> <b>Astute Watchman Methodology</b><br /> This charm allows the Solar to appoint a number of assistants up to her Essence rating. The Solar may use her Investigation charms through these assistants when they investigate a crime scene on the Solar's behalf. This allows the Solar to effectively investigate multiple crime scenes at the same time, but she does not know the results of any of these investigations until her assistants report back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T07:54:28-07:00","id":223262,"title":"","content":"Ride: <br /> <br /> <b>Lone Rider's Call</b><br /> The Solar beckons forth a wild beast to serve as a mount. No matter where the Solar is, a mount appropriate to his environment arrives quickly. So long as the charm remains active, the Solar may treat the animal as if it were a familiar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T07:28:31-07:00","id":224090,"title":"","content":"Sail:<br /> <br /> <b>Fallen Seas Navigation</b><br /> The Lawgiver knows all the currents of Creations, including those who that flow beyond the world. At the dawn or dusk of Creation, the Solar can activate this charm to sail her vessel into the oceans of the Wyld, the Underworld, Yu-Shan, or Malfeas, regardless of her current position. If she is in another realm already, she can use this charm to return to Creation. This charm can be used without restriction during Calibration, including to travel from one outworld Realm to another.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T07:04:53-07:00","id":225044,"title":"","content":"Athletics: <br /> <br /> <b>Shattering Thunder Step </b><br /> The Solar's every step sunders the ground and sends out earthquakes. In a contest of speed, the Solar may activate this charm to cause all opponents who are (Solar's Essence) ahead of or behind the Solar to roll for balance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T06:59:21-07:00","id":225905,"title":"","content":"Athletics: <br /> <br /> <b>Unstoppable Charge Stance</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm while crossing precarious terrain. This charm negates any terrain penalties for movement rolls and grants the Solar a number of bonus dice equal to the original penalty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T07:04:48-07:00","id":226995,"title":"","content":"Resistance:<br /> <br /> <b>Vengeful Essence Eruption</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm after suffering health damage greater than her Essence. Her Essence explodes outwards, sending her opponents back. The Solar rolls Stamina + Resistance, treating the eruption as a medium weapon with whichever tags a goremaul has. The attack does not deal any kind of damage, but can knock opponents back. By spending an additional 2XP, the Solar can upgrade the eruption to an artifact medium weapon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T06:11:34-07:00","id":227838,"title":"","content":"Sweet, I finally rolled something interesting. I was just brainstorming a system for Lore, too. <br /> <br /> Lore:<br /> <br /> <b>Astute Scholar Intuition</b><br /> The Solar can use this charm when attempting to solve a problem caused by something which is currently being hidden from her. The Solar uses her own common knowledge to devise a solution which, if executed properly, will prevent the problem from getting worse until the Solar can identify the root cause. If the cause of the problem somehow evolves to counter the Solar's efforts, the Solar may activate this charm again for one mote in order to learn which adjustments to make to her plan. This charm does not help against problems caused by completely lost knowledge, such as the Great Curse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T06:33:01-07:00","id":229018,"title":"","content":"Bureaucracy:<br /> <br /> <b>Silver Mountain's Shadow</b><br /> This charm supplements an attempt to buy something. So long as the Solar acts through proxies, no one will realize her involvement in the purchase unless she chooses to deliberately reveal it afterwards.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T06:45:54-07:00","id":230143,"title":"","content":"Occult:<br /> <br /> <b>Dragon Temple Alignment</b><br /> When the Solar is gathering sorcerous motes for a spell in a manse or demesne she is attuned to, she generates an additional amount of motes equal to the manse or demesne's rating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T07:02:34-07:00","id":231451,"title":"","content":"Craft:<br /> <br /> <b>Awaken the Sleeping Treasure</b><br /> The Solar's acknowledgement transforms the mundane into the wondrous. The Solar spends a scene interacting with a mundane object; she can trade blows against her rival's steel, admire a statue, or walk the walls of a fortress. At the end of the scene, the Solar may activate this charm and turn it into a 1-dot Artifact with evocations determined by the Solar based on the object's form, materials and relationship to the Solar. If it would be more appropriate, the Solar can turn the object into a 1-dot Solar Manse with powers chosen by the Solar instead. If the Manse is ever destroyed, its demesne does not linger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":54,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","user":"Tiresias","date":". 08-18-2014, 02:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T06:02:35-07:00","id":232774,"title":"","content":"Linguistics: <br /> <br /> <b>Assured Solar Authority</b><br /> The Solar applies her seal or signature to a document and activates this charm. Anyone who looks at the document automatically knows that it has been approved by the Solar. The document's holder gains a number of automatic successes equal to the Solar's Essence to any Threaten action against someone who denies the legitimacy of the Solar's signature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T11:35:40-07:00","id":233078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=231451#post231451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">she can trade blows against her rival's sleep</div> </div> </div> </div>Is this a typo, or is there some idiomatic meaning to fighting someone's sleep I'm not aware of?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T11:38:52-07:00","id":233080,"title":"","content":"It's a very odd typo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T06:41:32-07:00","id":234137,"title":"","content":"Linguistics: <br /> <br /> <b>Diagram of Celestial Instruction</b><br /> The Solar draws a diagram portraying the correct use of any of the Solar's abilities. Anyone who studies this diagram for one scene gains a number of bonus dice equal to the Solar's rating in that ability when they attempt to use it. This effect lasts for one day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T23:59:49-07:00","id":235120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=196338#post196338\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got a sort-of Integrity one congealing in my head; it's centered around focusing <i>so</i> intently on something that it becomes the only result on torture or mind-reading attempts.<br /> <br /> If you've seen <i>Justice League: Unlimited</i>, there's a scene where the Question is being tortured for information, and all he gives them are bizarre conspiracy theories (such as flouride making our teeth visible on spy satellites); likewise, in <i>The Stand</i>, Tom Cullen (curse Stephanie Meyer for tarnishing the name of Cullen!), the beacon of mental health that he is, thinks &quot;M-O-O-N&quot; spells everything under the sun, so when the villain attempts to use his powers to search for Tom, all he sees is the moon. <span style=\"color:white\">Okay, that was hypnosis, but I'm counting it.</span><br /> <br /> I'm trying to think of a third example, but none are coming to mind.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Young Justice.<br /> <br /> Miss Martian is trying to read Bane's mind, but all she gets are futbol scores...in Spanish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/370-oriares","name":"Oriares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar370_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T01:55:10-07:00","id":235216,"title":"","content":"There's also the Midwich Cuckoos, in which the protagonist blocks the powers of the psychic children by imagining a wall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T04:26:46-07:00","id":235301,"title":"","content":"That reminds me of the old X-Men cartoon where Sabretooth joins the team. Professor X reads his mind but there's a bricked off section he can't get to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/370-oriares","name":"Oriares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar370_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T10:30:42-07:00","id":235554,"title":"","content":"Survival:<br /> <br /> <b>Giant Beast's World-Scarring Wrath</b><br /> Upon learning this charm, the Solar's familiar develops a new terrifying attack or special ability. This ability is unique to the familiar and should be as powerful as one of the charms of a demon of the second circle or equivalent spirit. The Storyteller and the Solar's player should work together to create an appropriate ability.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-21T07:07:02-07:00","id":236435,"title":"","content":"Integrity:<br /> <br /> <b>Casting the Iron Hook</b><br /> The Solar makes a social influencing against one of the Fair Folk to make herself the target of its ire, rolling Appearance + Integrity and adding a number of automatic successes equal to her Essence. If the influence is successful and the Raksha later chooses to attack the Solar, it loses momentum equal to the Solar's Essence every time it attempts to use its charms on the Solar and fails.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-22T09:13:30-07:00","id":237045,"title":"","content":"Occult:<br /> <br /> <b>Light Without Darkness</b><br /> The Solar lays her hand on a ghost's brow and blazes her anima, burning away the ghost's darkness. From that moment onward, the ghost is no longer considered a creature of darkness. It can survive without penalty in either the Underworld, shadowlands, or Creation, but it does not respire motes in Creation unless it is within the area of influence of a manse attuned to the Solar whose blessing it received.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-23T06:55:23-07:00","id":238157,"title":"","content":"Socialize:<br /> <br /> <b>Golden Thread Unbound</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm after failing to negotiate peace between herself and an enemy. If the Solar immediately attacks her enemy after the negotiations fail, she may roll Manipulation + Socialize and add her successes to her momentum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-24T07:46:33-07:00","id":239104,"title":"","content":"Sail:<br /> <br /> <b>Western Wind's Guidance</b><br /> The Solar places her flagship at the head of her fleet and pulls the tide and wind in her wake. This charm allows the Solar to command a number of unmanned ships equal to her Essence to follow her flagship. So long as flagship succeeds its sail actions, the unmanned ships will follow successfully. This charm does not allow the unmanned ships to fight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-25T06:55:47-07:00","id":240238,"title":"","content":"Performance:<br /> <br /> <b>Eternal Twilight Repose</b><br /> This charm supplements an attempt to quell the undead. The Solar sings a requiem and rolls Performance as a social influence. If the roll succeeds, the undead are automatically drawn back into the Underworld, even if they are not currently in a Shadowland.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T06:48:17-07:00","id":241297,"title":"","content":"Craft:<br /> <br /> <b>Eternal Art Contingency</b><br /> If a mundane object crafted by the Solar is every destroyed, she may replace it with a backup copy. As the Solar was already prepared for this contingency, she does not need to spend any additional funds on materials and the reconstruction itself is accelerated. Small objects can be replaced instantly, while larger objects such as fortifications take up to a day to replace.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T08:01:24-07:00","id":242254,"title":"","content":"Survival:<br /> <br /> <b>Green and White Trapper's Noose</b><br /> The Solar scouts out an area in preparation for a battle and activates this charm to set a trap. So long as this charm is active, the trap is &quot;suspended.&quot; Upon deactivating the charm, the Solar selects a target and makes an opposed Wits + Survival roll against the target's Perception + Awareness. If the Solar succeeds, the target is affected by the trap.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T07:55:58-07:00","id":243094,"title":"","content":"Awareness:<br /> <br /> <b>Eastern Echo Mapping</b><br /> She smashes her heel against the floor and uses the sound's echo to map out a building. Upon activating this charm, the Solar rolls Perception + Awareness. Every success allows her to learn one fact about the building's architecture or inhabitants. For a small apartment, two successes are enough to obtain both a map and learn the number of people inside, but such information costs more successes for considerably larger structures. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T06:28:01-07:00","id":243844,"title":"","content":"Ride:<br /> <br /> <b>Lightning-Hoofed Sloth</b><br /> The Solar can spur her mount to implausible feats of acrobatics. The Solar can substitute her Strength + Ride for all of her mount's movement-related rolls, such as combat movement, dodge, climbing, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T06:33:09-07:00","id":243846,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=243844#post243844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ride:<br /> <br /> <b>Lightning-Hoofed Sloth</b><br /> The Solar can spur her mount to implausible feats of acrobatics. The Solar can substitute her Strength + Ride for all of her mount's movement-related rolls, such as combat movement, dodge, climbing, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Swimming? Jumping?<br /> <br /> This, along with some charm to enable you to ride any animal that would support your weight, would allow you to <a href=\"http://rs1img.memecdn.com/bitch-im-a-horse_o_1067619.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">turn</a> <a href=\"http://api.ning.com/files/I5cnde4*SK8OOVyk2pFB4vbL1rbmcm4wi03hm*jjThyVLGPkiS**hAKsGKWHs4o1fWEpeKEY5SOTuQEjUzzTIc3RNB-Spthl/064ce26a2294b7a082e0ccbb919f7d60.jpeg?width=600&amp;height=445\" target=\"_blank\">any</a> <a href=\"http://www.sluniverse.com/imageserver/snapzilla/266954.jpg?width=800&amp;height=&amp;bgcolor=black\" target=\"_blank\">mount</a> into a Golden Chocobo. I'm not sure if that's a very good thing or a very bad thing.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":908,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","user":"semicasual","date":". 08-29-2014, 10:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T07:35:15-07:00","id":243916,"title":"","content":"The ground sloth cavalry is effective in all terrains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T06:12:47-07:00","id":244759,"title":"","content":"Integrity:<br /> <br /> <b>Guiding Star Allegiance</b><br /> The Solar accepts a destiny from her Sidereal adviser, whether it be a blessing or a curse. In exchange, when she acts towards fulfilling that destiny, the Solar effectively gains all of the Vizier's Intimacies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T06:30:39-07:00","id":245314,"title":"","content":"Sail:<br /> <br /> <b>Still Ocean Rope</b><br /> This charm guarantees that anyone who falls off or is thrown off the Solar's ship will float on the surface of the water and be carried along the ship's path so they may be rescued. This charm does not function if the Solar's ship has received damage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T06:05:50-07:00","id":246101,"title":"","content":"Integrity:<br /> <br /> <b>Soaring Daystar Benevolence</b><br /> The light of the Lawgiver's soul banishes the deepest darkness. So long as this charm is active, Abyssal Exalted who are in the Solar's company and who hold a positive Intimacy towards her gain one less resonance than they normally would from their actions, to a minimum of one resonance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T09:07:42-07:00","id":246849,"title":"","content":"War<br /> <br /> <b>Bloodied Steel Defense</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm when a battle group under her command uses a defend other action to protect a group of non-combatants. If the defend other action is completely successful, the battle group gains a free counterattack against the attacker.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T12:58:36-07:00","id":248106,"title":"","content":"Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Burning Heart's Pledge</b><br /> The Solar writes a love letter to her romantic partner. Whenever someone attempts to erode the partner's tie to the Solar, the partner may resist the effect without having to spend willpower as long as he is carrying the letter on his person.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T12:13:59-07:00","id":249057,"title":"","content":"Lore:<br /> <br /> <b>Radiance of Eternal Essence</b><br /> <br /> The Essence of the Sun burns in all things. The Solar may use Wyld-Shaping Technique to create Solar-aspected demesnes attuned to her particular Essence. Those who sleep within the demesne receive prophetic dreams born of the Solar's wisdom which help them solve the problems and dispute of every day life. This effect persists if a manse is constructed upon the demesne.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T12:27:01-07:00","id":250034,"title":"","content":"Survival:<br /> <br /> <b>Law of the Beast King</b><br /> This charm supplements a Threaten action against a pack of animals acting as a battle group. If it succeeds, the battle group is immediately disbanded and the leader of the pack steps forward to fight the Solar in a duel as the rest of the animals watch passively unless provoked by someone else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T07:32:55-07:00","id":250751,"title":"","content":"Awareness:<br /> <br /> <b>False Canvas Mockery</b><br /> <br /> The Solar may activate this charm after spotting someone wearing a disguise. As long as the Solar keeps the target in her line of sight, the target is distracted by the Solar's unnerving gaze. She takes an internal penalty equal to the Solar's Awareness to all attempts to maintain her disguise, including bluffs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T06:17:12-07:00","id":251423,"title":"","content":"Sail:<br /> <br /> <b>Law of the Seas</b><br /> The Solar claims ownership of her ship and holds it by taking care of its upkeep. So long as the Solar is the ship's owner, she automatically knows where it is and anyone trying to steal the ship suffers an internal penalty equal to the Solar's Essence to the ship's maneuverability and speed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T12:47:56-07:00","id":252573,"title":"","content":"War:<br /> <br /> <b>Victorious Final Stand</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm to give a battle group under her command a clash attack against any other battle group in its range that attempts to move away.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T10:02:45-07:00","id":253388,"title":"","content":"Awareness<br /> <br /> <b>Lingering Whisper Echo</b><br /> The Solar immediately notices if someone around her is altering their voice through non-magical means. In addition, the Solar never forgets the sound of any voice she has heard in the past.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T16:13:13-07:00","id":253654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms?p=124431#post124431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Craft:<br /> <br /> <b>Instruction of the Celestial Design</b><br /> The Lawgiver writes down the plans and instructions necessary to create a mundane item which she has already crafted once. Anyone who reads and follows the Solar's instructions to craft this item uses the Solar's Attributes, Abilities and Merits rather than their own.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you should add &quot;at the time the blueprint was created&quot; after &quot;the Solar's Attributes, Abilities, and Merits&quot; to this charm. I do like this, and I know my Twilight Player would probaly like this idea as well. What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/566-the-third-fetich","name":"The Third Fetich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar566_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T09:47:15-07:00","id":254151,"title":"","content":"Or maybe add a secondary purchase so it always use the Solar's current stats. <br /> <br /> Bureaucracy:<br /> <br /> <b>Radiant Design Imputation</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm when making a shortlist of candidates for a bureaucratic position. The Solar only earmarks candidates who are familiar sufficiently familiar with the Solar and her organization's goals so as to not disrupt them. So long as they continue to honestly act as the Solar's subordinates, the candidates will not take any action that would obstruct the Solar's future plans in some way. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T13:09:38-07:00","id":254551,"title":"","content":"Craft:<br /> <br /> <b>Sword and Spear Transmutation</b><br /> The Solar may sacrifice one mundane item in order to craft another by using it as a component. Doing so allows the Solar add a number of automatic successes equal to her Essence to all her craft rolls to make the new object.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T09:13:07-07:00","id":255347,"title":"","content":"Integrity:<br /> <br /> <b>Unassailable Enmity Declaration</b><br /> When someone towards whom the Solar holds a negative intimacy attempts to use social influence on her, the Solar may activate this charm to temporarily suppress one of her other intimacies and deny her enemy leverage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T06:19:19-07:00","id":255979,"title":"","content":"Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>Ink and Wind Penmanship</b><br /> The Solar commits her knowledge to writing. If the writings are ever destroyed or forgotten, their content reemerges within the thoughts of appropriate philosophers from all across Creation, so that they can never be truly lost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T06:55:45-07:00","id":256614,"title":"","content":"Survival:<br /> <br /> <b>Undaunted Hunter's Sight</b><br /> The Solar may activate this charm to track a foe who has fled from her in combat. Every time the target rolls a 10 on her attempts to evade the Solar, the Solar gains 1 success to her tracking attempt. In addition, whenever the Solar succeeds a tracking roll, she gains 1 momentum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=