6230,"title":"","content":"Melee:<br /> <br /> <b>Fang-Blunting Strike</b><br /> This charm supplements a disarm action. Even if the action is unsuccessful, the power of the Solar's blow negates one of the targeted weapon's tags until the Solar's next action.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T09:21:02-07:00","id":266788,"title":"","content":"Thrown:<br /> <br /> <b>Soaring Steel Scorpion</b><br /> The Solar knows to aim for her enemy's weak points: her bleeding wounds. When the Solar uses a thrown attack to deliver a poison or crippling effect, she may activate this charm. The target's wound penalty increases by half the Solar's Essence rounded up for the purposes of resisting the effect. This charm only works if the target has suffered a wound penalty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters 